Cell["\<\
The event {1, 3} is reached by light sent at arc length 2 and echoed back at \
4.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"68f7b764-51a6-4b14-85fa-f46e87fafbfb"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"BondiRadarCoordinates", "[", 
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"c45bb452-62af-45d6-a452-1e2d4336cf62"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\<\"RadarTime\"\>", "\[Rule]", "3"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"RadarDistance\"\>", "\[Rule]", "1"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"EmitArcLength\"\>", "\[Rule]", "2"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"ReturnArcLength\"\>", "\[Rule]", "4"}]}], 
  "\[RightAssociation]"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[1]= ",ExpressionUUID->"4ca76077-57a1-47d0-b6f6-1f2a548806c5"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "At the light angle \[Pi]/3 the radar time is the same and the radar \
distance shrinks by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["cot",
    FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", "\[CurlyPhi]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "dc7b1f65-814b-47aa-80ff-5a06b309ba66"],
 "."
}], "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"04717a59-a939-4cec-a49c-17f76c9f48e1"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"BondiRadarCoordinates", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Pi", "/", "3"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[2]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"134ee1c8-84c7-450b-853b-e7560cb65136"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\<\"RadarTime\"\>", "\[Rule]", "3"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"RadarDistance\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    FractionBox["1", 
     SqrtBox["3"]]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"EmitArcLength\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"3", "-", 
     FractionBox["1", 
      SqrtBox["3"]]}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"ReturnArcLength\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"3", "+", 
     FractionBox["1", 
      SqrtBox["3"]]}]}]}], "\[RightAssociation]"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[2]= ",ExpressionUUID->"4848b444-296d-44ed-aee7-3b6ad1559bb0"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

